2. Import selenium module.
3. Change the firewall level through `dmcli`.
4. Start selenium hub in TM machine.
5. Start node in WLAN client machine.
6. Connect the WLAN client to the configured WiFi SSID.
7. Access the gateway WebUI using selenium grid.
8. Validate that the WebUI page is accessible.
9. Get the firewall level value from the WebUI.
10. Verify that the changed firewall value is reflected in the WebUI.
11. Kill selenium hub and node.
12. Unload module.', 'The changed firewall value must be reflected in the WebUI page.
', 'b9e33944-6f16-4e59-9b12-3e6a6964698c', '2026-09-02 10:17:34.833997', '2026-09-02 10:17:34.833999');
